From c64b3a9d02a01f92ea1756ca995cc7a99a423750 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MrScripty <TheEnvironmentGuy@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:26:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(project): inspect retained scientific fields in native
 projects

Share the existing numeric field inspector between workbench and native project readers. Pin native slices to the selected project checkpoint and source content, and clear cancelled or superseded reads without importing execution authority.
